{"seq":2,"slug":"tourism-resources-planning","title":"Tourism Resources Planning","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-resources-planning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tourism-resources-evaluation","title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅游资源分类与评价","url":"/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-resources-planning/tourism-resources-evaluation","wordCount":1787,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"scenic-area-planning","title":"大学旅游管理 — 景区规划与开发","url":"/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-resources-planning/scenic-area-planning","wordCount":1849,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"sustainable-ecotourism","title":"大学旅游管理 — 可持续旅游与生态旅游","url":"/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-resources-planning/sustainable-ecotourism","wordCount":1864,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# Tourism Resources Planning 简介\n\n本章讲旅游资源如何被识别、评估并转化为可落地的空间规划。先建立旅游资源的分类与评价方法，再讲景区从功能分区到产品动线的规划逻辑，最后引入可持续与生态旅游视角，约束开发强度与资源保护之间的平衡。三篇文档沿「评价资源 → 规划空间 → 守住可持续底线」递进，是旅游管理专业衔接资源学与规划实务的关键章节。\n"}